DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN
     The eemm driver provides support for PCI, PCI-X and PCI Express Gigabit
     Ethernet adapters based on the Intel 82540EM, 82540EP, 82541EI, 82541ER,
     82541GI, 82541PI, 82542, 82543GC, 82544EI, 82544GC, 82545EM, 82545GM,
     82546EB, 82546GB, 82547EI, 82547GI, 82562V, 82563EB, 82564EB, 82566DC,
     82566DM, 82571EB, 82571GB, 82572EI, 82572GI, 82573E, 82573L, 82573V,
     82574L, 82575EB, 82575GB, 82576EB, 82577LC, 82577LM, 82578DC, 82578DM,
     82579LM, 82579V, 82580DB, 82580EB, 82583V, I210, I211, I217, I218, I219,
     I350, I354 Ethernet controller chips and the embedded chips found on
