HHIISSTTOORRYY
     The eemm device driver first appeared in OpenBSD 3.2.

AAUUTTHHOORRSS
     The eemm driver was written by Intel Corporation.

BBUUGGSS
     There are known performance issues with this driver when running UDP
     traffic with jumbo frames.

     There is a known compatibility issue where time to link is slow or link
     is not established between 82541/82547 controllers and some switches.
     Known switches include:

           I-O Data ETG-SH8
           Planex FXG-08TE

